==Strategy==
Due to the enemy limit only being 8, these enemies will not spawn right away, but will spawn after you kill the previous enemies. Not much effort is required here, just make sure your [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] has the Target [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] [[Talents|Talent]].

==Trivia==
*Icarus' Instinct refers to the Greek legend of Daedalus' son [[wikipedia:Icarus|Icarus]]. In the legend, he ignored his father's warnings to not fly too close to the sun, melting his wax wings and sending him to a watery grave in the Icarian Sea.

